tch13/58-df-zfc-top2-topological-embedding.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a8591aa671cf9030\" href=\"?note=a8591aa671cf9030\" title=\"58-df-composite\">58-df-composite</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\beta X,K\\in V\">\\(X,\\beta X,K\\in V\\)</span> (topological carriers)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e:X\\to\\beta X\">\\(e:X\\to\\beta X\\)</span> (compactification embedding)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:X\\to K\">\\(f:X\\to K\\)</span> (test map for the universal property)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar f:\\beta X\\to K\">\\(\\bar f:\\beta X\\to K\\)</span> (unique extension witness)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_X,\\tau_{\\beta X},\\tau_K\">\\(\\tau_X,\\tau_{\\beta X},\\tau_K\\)</span> (topologies on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\beta X,K\">\\(X,\\beta X,K\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5DenseSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5DenseSet}_S\\)</span> (dense-subset predicate).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2TopologicalEmbedding}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2TopologicalEmbedding}_S\\)</span> (topological-embedding predicate).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S\\)</span> (continuous-map predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Composite}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Composite}_S\\)</span> (typed composition predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8StoneCechCompactification}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8StoneCechCompactification}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8CompactHausdorffSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8CompactHausdorffSpace}_S\\)</span> (compact Hausdorff space predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo8\\text{-}stone\\text{-}cech\\text{-}compactification} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo8StoneCechCompactification}_S(\\beta X,\\tau_{\\beta X},e;X,\\tau_X)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8CompactHausdorffSpace}_S(\\beta X,\\tau_{\\beta X})\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop2TopologicalEmbedding}_S(e,X,\\tau_X,\\beta X,\\tau_{\\beta X})\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5DenseSet}_S(\\beta X,\\tau_{\\beta X},e[X])\\land\\forall K,\\tau_K,f\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8CompactHausdorffSpace}_S(K,\\tau_K)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,K,\\tau_K)\\to\\exists!\\bar f\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S(\\bar f,\\beta X,\\tau_{\\beta X},K,\\tau_K)\\land\\mathrm{Composite}_S(f,\\bar f,e,X,\\beta X,K)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo8\\text{-}stone\\text{-}cech\\text{-}compactification} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo8StoneCechCompactification}_S(\\beta X,\\tau_{\\beta X},e;X,\\tau_X)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8CompactHausdorffSpace}_S(\\beta X,\\tau_{\\beta X})\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop2TopologicalEmbedding}_S(e,X,\\tau_X,\\beta X,\\tau_{\\beta X})\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5DenseSet}_S(\\beta X,\\tau_{\\beta X},e[X])\\land\\forall K,\\tau_K,f\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8CompactHausdorffSpace}_S(K,\\tau_K)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,K,\\tau_K)\\to\\exists!\\bar f\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S(\\bar f,\\beta X,\\tau_{\\beta X},K,\\tau_K)\\land\\mathrm{Composite}_S(f,\\bar f,e,X,\\beta X,K)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The exact upstream argument orders are used. The universal property quantifies over set-coded compact Hausdorff targets and continuous maps, while <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> is a dense topological embedding.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-zfc-topo8-compact-hausdorff-space","status":"resolved","id":"3639c3f839b6c954","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-topo8-compact-hausdorff-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set","status":"resolved","id":"855dfa27460aa1ec","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map","status":"resolved","id":"44867449c3df728b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-top2-topological-embedding.md","status":"resolved","id":"890a8458fc69d8c7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-top2-topological-embedding.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-composite","status":"resolved","id":"a8591aa671cf9030","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-composite]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\beta X,K\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"e:X\\to\\beta X","display":false},{"tex":"f:X\\to K","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar f:\\beta X\\to K","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_X,\\tau_{\\beta X},\\tau_K","display":false},{"tex":"X,\\beta X,K","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5DenseSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2TopologicalEmbedding}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Composite}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8StoneCechCompactification}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8Compa